        "id": 129707,
        "name": "TheSoundOfTrees",
        "username": "TheSoundOfTrees",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-29T13:26:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What bugs me is that I paid 40$ shipping but still have no game in sight - while if I had not pre-ordered, I would have the game right now, and for much less money, as I live right by my FLGS, only missing the promo cards.</p><p>I don't blame Greater Than Games, but I feel like I paid more money for having <em>less</em> than if I had been less enthusiastic.</p><p>Well. Hopefully, we'll see WotC coming our ways before the new pre-order is closed :D</p>",
