      {
        "id": 129708,
        "name": "Mezike",
        "username": "Mezike",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c6cbf5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-29T13:32:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MightySi\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mightysi/48/2168_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MightySi:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Please don't mistake this frustration for dickishness.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Don't worry, I don't think we attract that sort of crowd around here&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">  I think it's perfectly fine to vent your frustration, we're all annoyed but we just happen to be super nice people who don't want to push &gt;G into a more awkward position than they are currently in, or cause them to lose a lot of money just for the sake of us avoiding a little delayed gratification. The delays are no worse than the problem they had ages ago with the typhoon delaying the Kickstarter, stuff happens. Annoyed? Yes. Broken? No.</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
