      {
        "id": 129709,
        "name": "Under3",
        "username": "Under3",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/{size}/1872_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-29T13:51:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The difference here being stuff is already available at retail, which pretty much runs counter to the entire point of a pre-order.<br>\nIf there’s a prominent delay between being available in shops and what we’re waiting on then I think it is a perfectly legitimate request for other shipping options to be considered, after all its not like our shipping costs have been cheap.<br>\nIn regards to the comments about &gt;G making a loss on international shipping, I thought that only referred to previous kickstarters and not to their own pre order? I’m fairly sure we’ve covered cost for this.</p>\n<p>Personally for me frustration comes from having bought a copy for a friend and wanting it to be a nice surprise, which has been ruined by now having to tell him not to buy it at the shops.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:04:42.078Z",
