      {
        "id": 129711,
        "name": "MightySi",
        "username": "MightySi",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mightysi/{size}/2168_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-29T15:12:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I must admit im also confused about the better shipping rate they are saying about for non-Us folks.</p><p>When I ordered WOTC, I paid $30 shipping for a $20 game. &nbsp;The preorder Ive just placed for Villains\\oversized cards (to show support and to show I believe in second chances!) I've had to pay $37 shipping for $45 of game. &nbsp;I'm guessing the Villains box must be substantially heavier than WOTC to warrant the cost. At least its less than the cost of the game itself but \"special shipping rate\" isn't the wording I would advertise when it's much more expensive than last time.</p><p>I think Im done being a drag now, things are what they are. &nbsp;Am I disappointed in the way this has been strung out and handled? &nbsp;Yes, extremely. But I'm also more than willing to stay on board the &gt;G-Train.</p><p>But honestly, if it wasnt for the few promo bits, I'd be buying the game at a game store. &nbsp;Stoopid shiny promo cards. ;)</p><p>Ya know what, I think Im going to have a 5 v 5 Venegance game tonight, just to clear the air. Any team suggestions? :D</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
